+ Understand Linux users & permissions
    Learn these concepts:
    Users and groups
    File permissions: r w x
    Root vs normal user
    Why permissions matter in hacking
  - Practice commands in Kali:
    whoami
    id
    ls -l
    chmod 755 file.txt
    chmod +x file.txt
    In Numeric (Octal) Form:
    rwx = 7 (4 for read + 2 for write + 1 for execute)
    r-x = 5 (4 for read + 0 for write + 1 for execute)
    r-- = 4 (4 for read + 0 for write + 0 for execute)
